  memories:
  - title: The Beginning of the Party
    description: my first shift started normal at 7pm
    thumbnail: {fileID: 1214177884772094372, guid: 8754f2faaa5e6534c8f16a1304016a8a, type: 3}
    memoryIndex: 0
    prologueImage: {fileID: 1214177884772094372, guid: 8754f2faaa5e6534c8f16a1304016a8a, type: 3}
    prologueText: 'the party started out fine, just like any other fancy job i had
      ever done

'
  - title: The accident
    description: "\rthe second shift at 10pm started out chaotically"
    thumbnail: {fileID: -817027100272897854, guid: 15b93fbdd9bc4af4587d7239d38bcef4, type: 3}
    memoryIndex: 1
    prologueImage: {fileID: -817027100272897854, guid: 15b93fbdd9bc4af4587d7239d38bcef4, type: 3}
    prologueText: at the very beginning of my second shift the other waiter tripped
      and spilled a full glass of wine on top of the baron,  we were all really surprised.
  - title: 'The Calm Before '
    description: the third and final shift
    thumbnail: {fileID: 1772220627499986795, guid: ba69f8e9d78f1294094dd4d75cb711f3, type: 3}
    memoryIndex: 2
    prologueImage: {fileID: 1772220627499986795, guid: ba69f8e9d78f1294094dd4d75cb711f3, type: 3}
    prologueText: during my final shift things finally started to calm down, but
      not an easing calm, more of a cold front. it felt that something as if something
      was coming. little did i know.
  memorySceneName: GameScene
  unlockAllMemories: 1
